omorebi' effect (light filtering through trees) that plays across her face and kimono as the petals fall.\",\n    \"tone\": \"Dreamy, elegant, serene, and deeply poetic with a touch of wistful nostalgia (mono no aware).\"\n  },\n  \"color_palette\": \"A soft, harmonious palette dominated by shades of sakura pink, creamy whites, and the deep crimson of the umbrella. Accented by the pale green of new leaves, the warm gold of the sunlight, and the neutral grey of the stone path. Low contrast, ethereal feel.\",\n  \"output\": {\n    \"quality\": \"8K HDR\",\n    \"style\": \"Cinematic, high-end feature film quality footage.\"\n  }\n}"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 193, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 190, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [428.0284423828125, 141.5060272216797], "pos": [501.2052001953125, -1310.699951171875], "id": 6, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.45", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [195, 196, 197], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["色调艳丽，过曝，静态，细节模糊不清，字幕，风格，作品，画作，画面，静止，整体发灰，最差质量，低质量，JPEG压缩残留，丑陋的，残缺的，多余的手指，画得不好的手部，画得不好的脸部，畸形的，毁容的，形态畸形的肢体，手指融合，静止不动的画面，杂乱的背景，三条腿，背景人很多，倒着走"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 194, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [425.27801513671875, 180.6060791015625], "pos": [487.0641784667969, -1045.865234375], "id": 7, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.45", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for 